<title>UK: Tunisia buys 14,000 t white sugar for Feb/Mar.</title>
<headline>Tunisia buys 14,000 t white sugar for Feb/Mar.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia bought 14,000 tonnes of white sugar for arrival in February/March 1997 at a reported price of $374 per tonne, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>The sugar was high-quality 45 ICUMSA after a snap tender held on Thursday, they said.</p>
<p>Details of the supplier have yet to emerge.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8064</p>
